<title>RUSSIA: Belarus Jan-Sept industry output rises 2.6 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Belarus Jan-Sept industry output rises 2.6 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus industrial production in the first nine months of this year was 2.6 percent higher than in the same period a year earlier, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>Output in September was two percent higher than a year earlier.</p>
<p>    BELARUS INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	 SEP 96    AUG 95    SEP 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	  +1.4	+5.4	 N/A</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	    +2.0	+2.9     -11.5</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
